<p><a href="https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/habitat-murder-mystery-Oct-15.png"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter  wp-image-121383" src="https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/habitat-murder-mystery-Oct-15-600x600.png" alt="" width="402" height="402" srcset="https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/habitat-murder-mystery-Oct-15-600x600.png 600w, https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/habitat-murder-mystery-Oct-15-300x300.png 300w, https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/habitat-murder-mystery-Oct-15-150x150.png 150w, https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/habitat-murder-mystery-Oct-15.png 1000w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 402px) 100vw, 402px" /></a></p>
<p>Habitat for Humanity will present their second annual Murder Mystery Dinner Theater. This fun fundraiser will have dinner and a show, along with pre-show hors d&#8217;oevres. There will also be a silent and live auction, and casino games.</p>
<p><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"><script async src="https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-9318701447515491" crossorigin="anonymous"></script></span><br />
