<span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"><script>
     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});
</script></span></p>
<hr data-start="330" data-end="333" />
<p data-start="335" data-end="511">Sponsored by Ridout Lumber Company and Saline County Home Builders Association, the event is set for <strong>Thursday, October 15th</strong> at the Hill Barn Event Center on 100 Hill Road in Bryant. That&#8217;s off Reynolds Road and adjacent to Hill Barn Elementary School.</p>
<p data-start="335" data-end="511">Doors open at 6PM, dinner and show begins at 7PM and the auctions and casino games continue the evening at 8PM.</p>
<p data-start="335" data-end="511">Watch for information on tickets and more at <a href="https://habitatsalinecounty.com/">https://habitatsalinecounty.com/</a>.</p>
